				<h4>Lot essays</h4>

				<ul>
					<li><a href="https://www.phillips.com/detail/gio-ponti/UK050224/8">Lot 8, Gio Ponti, Unique extendable dining table, from Gio Ponti’s private residence, Via Dezza, Milan</a></li>
					<li><a href="https://www.phillips.com/detail/gio-ponti/UK050224/9">Lot 9, Gio Ponti, Folding table, model no. A90, from the ‘Apta’ series</a></li>
