				<h4>Lot essays</h4>

				<ul>
					<li><a href="https://www.phillips.com/detail/shiro-kuramata/210151">Lot 17, Shiro Kuramata, Early ‘How High the Moon’ two-seater sofa</a></li>
					<li><a href="https://www.phillips.com/detail/hans-j.-wegner/211892">Lot 51, Hans J. Wegner, ‘China’ armchair, model no. 4283</a></li>
					<li><a href="https://www.phillips.com/detail/gerrit-thomas-rietveld/211890">Lot 64, Gerrit Thomas Rietveld, ‘Zig-Zag’ chair</a></li>
